  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDRI has undertaken to act as agent for Sida and dispurse payments to and accept reports from Ministry of Public Works and Transport in connection with the production of the study: A medium Term Strategy for Development of a Provincial Roads Network. The mission has been accomplished and the study received.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdrag &#xe5;t CDRI att fungera som mellanhand &#xe5;t Sida och utbetala ers&#xe4;ttningar och motta rapporter fr&#xe5;n Ministry of Public Works and Transport g&#xe4;llande framtagandet av studien: A Medium Term Strategy for Development of a Provincial Road Network. Uppdraget har slutf&#xf6;rts och studien mottagits.</narrative>
  </description>
